            "heading": "Lightweight",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "subheading": "Technology",
            "description": "<p>The lightweight construction feels almost like you’re wearing nothing at all, allowing you to focus fully on your ride, whether it's a challenging climb or a fast-paced descent. If you're looking for a jersey that balances minimal weight with maximum performance, this is the one for you. Perfect for cyclists who want to push their limits while staying cool and comfortable.</p>",
            "text_alignment": "center",
