            "image": "shopify://shop_images/upf.jpg",
            "heading": "Sun Protection",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "subheading": "UPF",
            "description": "<p>Made from the innovative Revolutional® fabric by Carvico, this jersey is not only lightweight but also breathable, ensuring that it fits like a second skin. The UPF 50+ rating provides essential protection against harmful UV rays, making it an ideal choice for summer rides. </p>",
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "button_label": "Learn More",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/womens-long-sleeve-summer-cycling-jersey",
            "button_style": "btn--primary"
